Draft patch — PR #128 DNS timeout (CONFIRMED, verdicts.md item 43). webhook_client awaited lookup_host with no bound; WEBHOOK_TIMEOUT only applied to the reqwest client built after resolution, so a stalled resolver blocks the sequential reply worker (holding FOR UPDATE delivery rows). Wraps the lookup in tokio::time::timeout(WEBHOOK_TIMEOUT, ...), mirroring outbound.rs's bounded resolve. Uncompiled in the authoring sandbox; run cargo check before landing.

